# Imported Design Skills — External Origin

Purpose:
  Registry of design skills imported from external repositories.
  Each subdirectory preserves the original SKILL.md verbatim with a
  provenance INDEX.sdd wrapper per CLAUDE.md import rules.

Owns: ./

Source: https://github.com/Leonxlnx/taste-skill
Origin: tmp/taste-skill/skills/
Imported: 2026-09-06
Format: anthropic-skill (SKILL.md docs-only, adapted via INDEX.sdd wrappers)
License: MIT
Note: tmp-analysis.sdd attributes this repo to "vercel/taste-skill"; git remote
      and plugin.json both say Leonxlnx/taste-skill — repo state is authoritative.

Skills:
  taste-skill:
    one_line: Core design taste evaluation and aesthetic judgment
  minimalist-skill:
    one_line: Minimalist design principles and restraint
  brutalist-skill:
    one_line: Brutalist design patterns and bold structure
  stitch-skill:
    one_line: Design-to-code stitching workflow (SKILL.md + DESIGN.md)
  redesign-skill:
    one_line: Systematic redesign of existing interfaces
  output-skill:
    one_line: Design output quality and polish criteria
  image-to-code-skill:
    one_line: Converting design images to code

Rules:
  [IMP1] Every imported skill MUST carry Source + Origin + Imported + Format in its INDEX.sdd.
  [IMP2] These are design-reference skills — adapt, never copy blindly.
  [IMP3] Imported skills are CANDIDATES (Phase 146 lifecycle: EXTERNAL â†’ CANDIDATE â†’ ACTIVE).
  [IMP4] Human review required for CANDIDATE â†’ ACTIVE promotion.
  [IMP5] When overlapping with .sdd/skills/design/*.sdd native skills, native wins.

